{"version":1,"key":"card:245","content":{"id":245,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f7b9a90a-afb6-42ba-bdb9-df80f0571f59","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Set"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以看做是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"StrongSet"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所谓的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Strong"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 指的是集合中的元素保持对对象的引用，例如"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"58d05ec3-054e-4448-88e7-609e9752f302","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f1fb4bbd-bb7b-459e-80ff-2d5c8a984710","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"let set = new Set();\nlet key = {\n  name: \"Alice\",\n};\n\nset.add(key);\n\nkey = null;","collabId":"3740e832-7ade-47e3-9987-a38418b89db8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"25fe84c9-0663-418d-bf34-d89fef6efa62","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面我们为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Set"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 集合中添加了一个对象 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"key"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，随后将对象 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"key"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 设置为了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"null"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，但是集合仍然保持着对对象的引用，这就意味着无法回收此对象(这个对象已经无法访问，按道理应该被回收掉)，可能会造成内存泄漏的问题。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3085af36-664d-408a-bf8c-3fce5e3efc7c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以相应的提出了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"WeakSet"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所谓的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"WeakSet"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 指的是其中的元素没有保持的对对象的引用，如果对象被设置为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"null"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么该对象就可以被回收"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"0747101c-69fc-4591-ba42-c023047ccade","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"6ae496fa-0e68-4b1d-b946-8e8d883dea58","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"let weakSet = new WeakSet();\nlet key = {\n  name: \"Alice\",\n};\n\nweakSet.add(key);\n\n// 设置为 null 了，对象可以被作为垃圾回收了\nkey = null;","collabId":"c0a2b447-4a1e-4e96-8b97-06df14d41bc7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2fc8f430-5444-4822-89fc-99b6864e4610","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"WeakSet"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 提供与 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Set"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 相似的 API"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"367cf0b7-629d-4596-9f7d-944f53bc609c","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"546a3811-7374-4dfa-9c05-9f39934824f9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e0c9e6f2-e99e-467e-bfe9-1c50f628ce96","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"add"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"753b39f8-3d8a-459f-bc0d-a999a2f72544","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"55c465cd-edb8-4b04-89ff-6bad4fc80313","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"has"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1